window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-ca4b0317b84a1207"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"track-bills-subscriptions-and-spending\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">跟踪账单、订阅和支出</h1> <p>回顾最近 30 天，及时发现异常。</p> <p>在网页端使用 ChatGPT Work 查看已连接账户，了解支出和储蓄情况，并在需要注意时收到提醒。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>了解支出、储蓄、账户增长和即将到期的账单。</li> <li>只读的日常监测，并每两周收到一份简短报告。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">finances（需联网）</a></td> <td>在 ChatGPT 中查看已连接账户的支出、即将付款项目、周期性账单和订阅。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>查看你的财务情况</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>low</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances 请检查我最近 30 天的财务情况。展示我的支出、储蓄、账户余额及其变化，并指出任何异常。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 ChatGPT 中使用 Finances（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10291617\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT 中的定时任务（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/plan-budget-and-schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">规划预算与日程（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"before-you-start\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">开始之前</h2> <p>在网页端的 ChatGPT Work 中，从侧边栏打开 <strong>Finances</strong>，添加 Finances 插件并连接你的财务账户。之后可以使用 <code>@Finances</code> 查询账户。桌面应用中没有 Finances。</p> <p>Finances 只提供只读访问：它可以查看已连接账户，但不能转移资金、支付账单、取消订阅、进行交易或更改账户设置。财务数据可能不完整，也可能被错误分类；对任何需要你处理的事项，请先核实。</p> <p><a id=\"what-to-expect\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">可以期待什么</h2> <p>先请它检查最近 30 天，概述支出和储蓄的变化，并指出异常情况。之后再要求它每日检查，并每两周生成一份简短报告。</p> <p><a id=\"example-result\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_8\">示例结果</h3> <p>最近 30 天的支出合计为 $4,280，储蓄增加了 $820，现金和投资账户的合计余额增加了 $930。餐饮支出比上个月增加。一笔不熟悉的 $42 扣款和一项疑似重复的订阅续费需要进一步核实。</p> <p>后续可以要求它在需要注意时每日提醒，并每两周提供简短报告。已连接的财务账户只读。</p> <p><a id=\"take-it-further\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">进一步使用</h2> <p><strong>设置每日监测</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check every day and only notify me when something needs my attention. Every two weeks, send me a short report.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">每天检查一次，只有出现需要我关注的事项时才通知我。每两周给我发送一份简短报告。</div></div> <p><strong>找出可能忘记的订阅</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Find recurring charges across my accounts and flag any subscriptions that increased in price or that I may no longer use.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Finances 查找我各个账户中的周期性扣费，并标出涨价了或我可能已经不再使用的订阅。</div></div> <p><strong>查看资金去向</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Break down my spending over the last 30 days and show me which categories changed most from the previous month.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Finances 按类别拆解我过去 30 天的支出，并说明哪些类别相较上个月变化最大。</div></div> <p><strong>查看近期账单</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Show me which bills and subscriptions are coming up in the next two weeks and flag anything unusual.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Finances 列出未来两周即将到期的账单和订阅，并标出任何异常情况。</div></div> <p><strong>跟踪储蓄进展</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Show me how my savings and account balances have changed over the last 30 days and flag anything that may affect my progress.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Finances 展示过去 30 天我的储蓄和账户余额发生了哪些变化，并标出可能影响我进展的事项。</div></div> <p><strong>调查不熟悉的扣款</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Help me understand this charge, check whether it has appeared before, and tell me what I should verify.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Finances 帮我理解这笔扣费，检查它以前是否出现过，并告诉我应该核实哪些信息。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"track-bills-subscriptions-and-spending\">Track bills, subscriptions, and spending</h1> <p>Review the last 30 days and stay ahead of anything unusual.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work on the web to review connected accounts, understand your spending and savings, and get notified when something needs attention.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Understanding spending, savings, account growth, and upcoming bills.</li> <li>Read-only daily monitoring with a short report every two weeks.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">finances (online)</a></td> <td>Review connected spending, upcoming payments, recurring bills, and subscriptions in ChatGPT.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Check your finances</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>low</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Check my finances for the last 30 days. Show me my spending, savings, account balances and growth, and anything unusual.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Finances in ChatGPT (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10291617\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scheduled tasks in ChatGPT (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/plan-budget-and-schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plan a budget and schedule (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"before-you-start\">Before you start</h2> <p>In ChatGPT Work on the web, open <strong>Finances</strong> in the sidebar, add the Finances plugin, and connect your financial accounts. You can then use <code>@Finances</code> to check your accounts. Finances is not available in the desktop app.</p> <p>Finances is read-only: it can review your connected accounts, but it cannot move money, pay bills, cancel subscriptions, make trades, or change your account settings. Financial data can be incomplete or categorized incorrectly, so verify anything that needs your attention.</p> <h2 id=\"what-to-expect\">What to expect</h2> <p>Start by asking for a review of the last 30 days, including changes to your spending and savings and anything unusual. Then ask for a daily check and a short report every two weeks.</p> <h3 id=\"example-result\">Example result</h3> <p>In the last 30 days, spending totaled $4,280, savings increased by $820, and combined cash and investment balances grew by $930. Dining increased compared with the previous month. An unfamiliar $42 charge and a possible duplicate subscription renewal need review.</p> <p>As a follow-up, ask for daily alerts when something needs attention and a short report every two weeks. Connected financial accounts are read-only.</p> <h2 id=\"take-it-further\">Take it further</h2> <p><strong>Set up daily monitoring</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check every day and only notify me when something needs my attention. Every two weeks, send me a short report.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Find subscriptions you forgot about</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Find recurring charges across my accounts and flag any subscriptions that increased in price or that I may no longer use.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>See where your money went</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Break down my spending over the last 30 days and show me which categories changed most from the previous month.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Check upcoming bills</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Show me which bills and subscriptions are coming up in the next two weeks and flag anything unusual.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Track your savings progress</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Show me how my savings and account balances have changed over the last 30 days and flag anything that may affect my progress.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Investigate an unfamiliar charge</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Finances Help me understand this charge, check whether it has appeared before, and tell me what I should verify.\n</code></pre>"};
